{"overview":"ژوئن ۱۹۴۰. فرانسه سقوط می‌کند و پیمان تسلیم را امضا می‌کند. در میان این آشوب، مردی از تسلیم شدن امتناع می‌کند. تنها در برابر شانس، این ژنرال ناشناخته به لندن فرار می‌کند تا چیزی از آزادی را نجات دهد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"June, 1940. France collapses and signs the armistice. In the midst of the chaos, one man refuses to give up. Alone against the odds, this unknown general flees to London to save what remains of freedom.","tagline_en":"Some wars are won by armies. Others by those who refuse to surrender.","runtime":160,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Antonin Baudry"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["FR","BE","US"],"cast":[{"name":"سیمون آبکاریان","role":"Charles de Gaulle","photo":"/rpw1AujIl0vJD6cyMDo2ykJ8rZA.jpg","en":"Simon Abkarian"},{"name":"Simon Russell Beale","role":"Winston Churchill","photo":"/uw0ngaqgT8qXwJqVr353cx1mEdB.jpg"},{"name":"Florian Lesieur","role":"Fernand","photo":"/4oJ9Ipk9Twk1pO3hkYnt9rPtRiz.jpg"},{"name":"بونوآ ماژیمل","role":"Koenig","photo":"/pdXiN4doHkWmIF18mDg6pe0RtAv.jpg","en":"Benoît Magimel"},{"name":"Mathieu Kassovitz","role":"Darlan","photo":"/3FRBEdKKlxhvPWPt0jzgmSjeHwn.jpg"},{"name":"Loïc Corbery","role":"Pleven","photo":"/iAGGz3Z7v2Us45kLhKSnow63IjC.jpg"},{"name":"Anamaria Vartolomei","role":"Livia","photo":"/jRU3453OyqirChIl2EEevhliAjq.jpg"},{"name":"Niels Schneider","role":"Général Leclerc","photo":"/eG7go6nzgnb791avzYoN7GSqPd6.jpg"},{"name":"Félix Kysyl","role":"Jean Moulin/Rex","photo":"/5Likh6Ga5qP4szMBlC6xLIr82oY.jpg"},{"name":"Karim Leklou","role":"Blazej","photo":"/bgOpQ2WAwvxLFoRYFsPRAT0esAh.jpg"},{"name":"Tom Mison","role":"Anthony Eden","photo":"/aBDtRCCGgE3Zug2krAhL2IfyvWO.jpg"},{"name":"Kacey Mottet Klein","role":"Courcel","photo":"/ggOHPk5DHQzf9t4Qm4sohmtcNVf.jpg"}],"trailer":"dKUArYoZ_0U","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1165366"}